<title>THAILAND: Banpu Coal Sept 30 Q1 net drops.</title>
<headline>Banpu Coal Sept 30 Q1 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the three months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			     First quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	     3.22     vs	     5.12</p>
<p>    Net			164.77     vs	   252.05</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Banpu Plc, a coal miner and importer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
